 const auto='<ul class="iu-list"><li><strong>Agenda and pre-read draft</strong> (meeting_before_draft): '+LEAD+' days before each meeting, drafted on your Claude or ChatGPT runner and created in review.</li><li><strong>Ready for review</strong> (ready_for_review): an email to you when an update reaches In review.</li><li><strong>New question or offer of help</strong> (new_response): an email per new response.</li><li><strong>Weekly digest</strong> (weekly_digest): Mondays 08:00, written by the app; nothing to report sends nothing.</li><li><strong>Scheduled email update</strong> (scheduled_draft): one per email plan, set up from the plan.</li></ul><p class="iu-muted">They live in Automations (sidebar), where you turn them on or off and change times and recipients; this app stores no schedules, recipients or switches. Sends, answers and reminders are never automations here: a person confirms each one. Access (sidebar) decides who can see updates and who may send to people outside the workspace.</p>';
